<p>The most notable differentiator for STR Secrets is its focus on tax strategy. Most STR coaching programs teach operations, listing optimization, and guest management. STR Secrets goes deeper into the financial architecture of STR investing, covering topics like cost segregation, bonus depreciation, and how to structure deals for maximum tax efficiency.</p>
