<p><strong>Brokerage only.</strong> This is the most significant limitation. The Short Term Shop helps you buy, but that is where their service ends. There is no furnishing, no interior design, no listing optimization, no pricing strategy, no tax planning, no cost segregation, and no property management. You get the keys and then you are on your own.</p>
